{
  "_readme": [
    "Fixed question set, written 2026-11-18 before scoring. Each question is one a rider or a reporter would ask, with a known right answer.",
    "Answers are checked against the saved MTA feeds in test/fixtures/ (pulled 2026-09-16 and 2026-09-17) and the bundled snapshots in data/. No request goes to MTA. Run: npm run eval.",
    "Each step calls one tool. Checks: `equals` [path, value]; `includes` [path, value] (an array holds the value, or a string contains it); `length` [path, n]; `sorted` [path to an array of objects, field, values] (that field across the array, sorted, equals the values). Paths are dotted; numbers index arrays.",
    "The expected answers come from MTA's own records in the fixtures: alert ids, stop ids and equipment codes as MTA published them.",
    "What it scores: the tools' answers to scripted calls, so a wrong answer from the server is caught. It does not score an AI assistant choosing the tools; that needs a model in the loop and is a separate run."
  ],
  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "Q01",
      "q": "Will the 6 stop at 68 St-Hunter College on Saturday, September 19, 2026?",
      "steps": [
        {
          "tool": "check_route_on_date",
          "args": {
            "route_id": "6",
            "date": "2026-09-19",
            "station": "68 St-Hunter College"
          },
          "check": {
            "equals": [
              [
                "station.stop_id",
                "628"
              ],
              [
                "disrupted",
                false
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "note": "The 6 is suspended in the Bronx that weekend (614 to 619), not at 628. MTA's mercury_alert.affected_stations lists the whole route, so a reader of that field would wrongly say yes."
    },
    {
      "id": "Q02",
      "q": "What is happening on the 6 train on 2026-09-19?",
      "steps": [
        {
          "tool": "get_service_alerts",
          "args": {
            "route_id": "6",
            "date": "2026-09-19"
          },
          "check": {
            "equals": [
              [
                "alert_count",
                1
              ],
              [
                "alerts.0.entity_id",
                "lmm:planned_work:33826"
              ],
              [
                "alerts.0.alert_type",
                "Planned - Part Suspended"
              ],
              [
                "alerts.0.betanyc.effect",
                "reduced"
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Q03",
      "q": "Which stations does the 6 skip that weekend?",
      "steps": [
        {
          "tool": "get_service_alerts",
          "args": {
            "route_id": "6",
            "date": "2026-09-19"
          },
          "check": {
            "sorted": [
              [
                "alerts.0.affected_stops",
                "stop_id",
                [
                  "614",
                  "615",
                  "616",
                  "617",
                  "618",
                  "619"
                ]
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Q04",
      "q": "How many subway service alerts are in effect on 2026-09-19, on all lines?",
      "steps": [
        {
          "tool": "get_service_alerts",
          "args": {
            "date": "2026-09-19"
          },
          "check": {
            "equals": [
              [
                "alert_count",
                9
              ],
              [
                "paging.total",
                9
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Q05",
      "q": "Is there planned work on Wednesday, September 16, 2026?",
      "steps": [
        {
          "tool": "get_service_alerts",
          "args": {
            "date": "2026-09-16",
            "planned_only": true
          },
          "check": {
            "equals": [
              [
                "alert_count",
                1
              ],
              [
                "alerts.0.entity_id",
                "lmm:planned_work:33366"
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Q06",
      "q": "I'm meeting someone at 125 St. Which station is that?",
      "steps": [
        {
          "tool": "resolve_station",
          "args": {
            "query": "125 St"
          },
          "check": {
            "equals": [
              [
                "match_count",
                4
              ],
              [
                "unambiguous",
                false
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "tool": "resolve_station",
          "args": {
            "query": "125 St",
            "route_id": "6"
          },
          "check": {
            "equals": [
              [
                "match_count",
                1
              ],
              [
                "candidates.0.stop_id",
                "621"
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "note": "Four stations share the name. The right answer asks which line, or names all four; with the 6 it is 621."
    },
    {
      "id": "Q07",
      "q": "Is the 4/5/6 platform at 14 St-Union Sq wheelchair accessible?",
      "steps": [
        {
          "tool": "resolve_station",
          "args": {
            "query": "14 St-Union Sq",
            "route_id": "6"
          },
          "check": {
            "equals": [
              [
                "candidates.0.stop_id",
                "635"
              ],
              [
                "candidates.0.accessibility.status",
                "not_accessible"
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "note": "The complex's L and N/Q/R/W stations are accessible; the 4/5/6 station is not. A complex-level answer would be wrong."
    },
    {
      "id": "Q08",
      "q": "Are any elevator or escalator outages scheduled at Jamaica-179 St?",
      "steps": [
        {
          "tool": "get_accessibility_outages",
          "args": {
            "station": "Jamaica-179 St",
            "upcoming": true
          },
          "check": {
            "equals": [
              [
                "outage_count",
                3
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Q09",
      "q": "Which elevators at Jamaica-179 St are out on September 28, 2026?",
      "steps": [
        {
          "tool": "get_accessibility_outages",
          "args": {
            "station": "Jamaica-179 St",
            "date": "2026-09-28"
          },
          "check": {
            "sorted": [
              [
                "outages",
                "equipment",
                [
                  "EL431",
                  "EL432",
                  "EL433"
                ]
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Q10",
      "q": "How many elevator and escalator outages are there on the 6 line?",
      "steps": [
        {
          "tool": "get_accessibility_outages",
          "args": {
            "route_id": "6"
          },
          "check": {
            "equals": [
              [
                "outage_count",
                7
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Q11",
      "q": "Are the elevators at Union St (R) out?",
      "steps": [
        {
          "tool": "get_accessibility_outages",
          "args": {
            "stop_id": "R32"
          },
          "check": {
            "equals": [
              [
                "outage_count",
                0
              ],
              [
                "other_station_outages.0.station",
                "14 St-Union Sq"
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "note": "A name search for 'Union St' also matches 14 St-Union Sq's rows. MTA's inventory places them at R20, so the answer for R32 is none."
    },
    {
      "id": "Q12",
      "q": "Where does the elevator outage information come from?",
      "steps": [
        {
          "tool": "get_accessibility_outages",
          "args": {},
          "check": {
            "includes": [
              [
                "data_source",
                "https://api.mta.info/#/EAndEFeeds"
              ],
              [
                "disclaimer",
                "Unofficial"
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
